ers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review1-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","source_quote":"　　丘靈鞠，吳興烏程人也。祖系，祕書監。","reading":"丘靈鞠吳興烏程人，祖系曾任祕書監。","note":"丘靈鞠吳興烏程人，祖系曾任祕書監。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":20,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review2-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","source_quote":"　　靈鞠少好學，善屬文。與上計，仕郡爲吏。州辟從事，詣領軍沈演之。演之曰：「身昔爲州職，詣領軍謝晦，賔主坐處，政如今日。卿將來或復如此也。」舉秀才，爲州主簿。累遷員外郎。","reading":"沈演之追述見謝晦，場景與丘靈鞠此番謁見對照。","note":"沈演之追述見謝晦，場景與丘靈鞠此番謁見對照。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p002","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":85,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review3-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","source_quote":"　　宋孝武殷貴妃亡，靈鞠獻輓歌詩三首，云「雲橫廣階闇，霜深高殿寒」。帝擿句嗟賞。除新安王北中郎參軍，出爲剡烏程令，不得志。泰始初，坐東賊黨錮數年。褚淵爲吳興，謂人曰：「此郡才士，唯有丘靈鞠及沈勃耳。」乃啓申之。明帝使著《大駕南討紀論》。久之，除太尉參軍，轉安北記室，帶扶風太守，不就。爲尚書三公郎，建康令，轉通直郎，兼中書郎。","reading":"殷貴妃亡後作輓歌，兩位丘、沈才士之稱出於褚淵；宋明帝命撰紀論。","note":"殷貴妃亡後作輓歌，兩位丘、沈才士之稱出於褚淵；宋明帝命撰紀論。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":163,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review4-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","source_quote":"　　昇明中，遷正員郎，領本郡中正，兼中書郎如故。時方禪讓，太祖使靈鞠參掌詔策。建元元年，轉中書郎，中正如故，敕知東宮手筆。尋又掌知國史。明年，出爲鎮南長史、尋陽相，遷尚書左丞。世祖卽位，轉通直常侍，尋領東觀祭酒。靈鞠曰：「久居官不願數遷，使我終身爲祭酒，不恨也。」永明二年，領驍騎將軍。靈鞠不樂武位，謂人曰：「我應還東掘顧榮冢。江南地方數千里，士子風流，皆出此中。顧榮忽引諸傖渡，妨我輩塗轍，死有餘罪。」改正員常侍。","reading":"宋齊交代之際掌詔策。建元後兼國史，永明二年領驍騎，顧榮語為不樂武位之自述。","note":"宋齊交代之際掌詔策。建元後兼國史，永明二年領驍騎，顧榮語為不樂武位之自述。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":208,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:source_review5-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","source_quote":"　　靈鞠好飲酒，臧否人物，在沈淵座見王儉詩，淵曰：「王令文章大進。」靈鞠曰：「何如我未進時？」此言達儉。靈鞠宋世文名甚盛，入齊頗減。蓬髮弛縱，無形儀，不治家業。王儉謂人曰：「丘公仕宦不進，才亦退矣。」遷長沙王車騎長史，太中大夫，卒。著《江左文章錄序》，起太興，訖元熙。文集行於世。","reading":"丘靈鞠與沈淵評王儉詩。末太中大夫而卒，未載卒年。《江左文章錄序》太興至元熙說書的範圍。","note":"丘靈鞠與沈淵評王儉詩。末太中大夫而卒，未載卒年。《江左文章錄序》太興至元熙說書的範圍。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p005","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":140,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-liang027-qiuchi-father","subject_person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy_A","object_person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父靈鞠","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-049","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-049-daoqia-qiuchi","source_id":"s-liangshu-049-daoqia-qiuchi-ws1500650","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-049-daoqia-qiuchi:p001","quote":"丘遲字希範，吳興烏程人也。父靈鞠，有才名，仕齊官至太中大夫。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-049-daoqia-qiuchi:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-049-daoqia-qiuchi:p001:m0014"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"丘遲字希範，父靈鞠。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-qi052-lingju-grandfather","subj