，祕書監。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":12,"last_line":12,"raw_start":163,"raw_end":183,"raw_character_offsets":[163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"丘靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p001:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"系","kind":"person","person_id":"bj0_ty3_ndr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p002","text":"　　靈鞠少好學，善屬文。與上計，仕郡爲吏。州辟從事，詣領軍沈演之。演之曰：「身昔爲州職，詣領軍謝晦，賔主坐處，政如今日。卿將來或復如此也。」舉秀才，爲州主簿。累遷員外郎。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":14,"last_line":14,"raw_start":185,"raw_end":270,"raw_character_offsets":[185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p002:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p002:m0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"沈演之","kind":"person","person_id":"bc8_80d_613","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p002:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"演之","kind":"person","person_id":"bc8_80d_613","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p002:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"謝晦","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003","text":"　　宋孝武殷貴妃亡，靈鞠獻輓歌詩三首，云「雲橫廣階闇，霜深高殿寒」。帝擿句嗟賞。除新安王北中郎參軍，出爲剡烏程令，不得志。泰始初，坐東賊黨錮數年。褚淵爲吳興，謂人曰：「此郡才士，唯有丘靈鞠及沈勃耳。」乃啓申之。明帝使著《大駕南討紀論》。久之，除太尉參軍，轉安北記室，帶扶風太守，不就。爲尚書三公郎，建康令，轉通直郎，兼中書郎。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":16,"last_line":16,"raw_start":272,"raw_end":435,"raw_character_offsets":[272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324,325,326,327,328,329,330,331,332,333,334,335,336,337,338,339,340,341,342,343,344,345,346,347,348,349,350,351,352,353,354,355,356,357,358,359,360,361,362,363,364,365,366,367,368,369,370,371,372,373,374,375,376,377,378,379,380,381,382,383,384,385,386,387,388,389,390,391,392,393,394,395,396,397,398,399,400,401,402,403,404,405,406,407,408,409,410,411,412,413,414,415,416,417,418,419,420,421,422,423,424,425,426,427,428,429,430,431,432,433,434],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"宋孝武","kind":"person","person_id":"hx8_st4_jdd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"殷貴妃","kind":"person","person_id":"954_d3c_24e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"褚淵","kind":"person","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"丘靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"沈勃","kind":"person","person_id":"k7j_9yf_vhd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p003:m0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004","text":"　　昇明中，遷正員郎，領本郡中正，兼中書郎如故。時方禪讓，太祖使靈鞠參掌詔策。建元元年，轉中書郎，中正如故，敕知東宮手筆。尋又掌知國史。明年，出爲鎮南長史、尋陽相，遷尚書左丞。世祖卽位，轉通直常侍，尋領東觀祭酒。靈鞠曰：「久居官不願數遷，使我終身爲祭酒，不恨也。」永明二年，領驍騎將軍。靈鞠不樂武位，謂人曰：「我應還東掘顧榮冢。江南地方數千里，士子風流，皆出此中。顧榮忽引諸傖渡，妨我輩塗轍，死有餘罪。」改正員常侍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":18,"last_line":18,"raw_start":437,"raw_end":645,"raw_character_offsets":[437,438,439,440,441,442,443,444,445,446,447,448,449,450,451,452,453,454,455,456,457,458,459,460,461,462,463,464,465,466,467,468,469,470,471,472,473,474,475,476,477,478,479,480,481,482,483,484,485,486,487,488,489,490,491,492,493,494,495,496,497,498,499,500,501,502,503,504,505,506,507,508,509,510,511,512,513,514,515,516,517,518,519,520,521,522,523,524,525,526,527,528,529,530,531,532,533,534,535,536,537,538,539,540,541,542,543,544,545,546,547,548,549,550,551,552,553,554,555,556,557,558,559,560,561,562,563,564,565,566,567,568,569,570,571,572,573,574,575,576,577,578,579,580,581,582,583,584,585,586,587,588,589,590,591,592,593,594,595,596,597,598,599,600,601,602,603,604,605,606,607,608,609,610,611,612,613,614,615,616,617,618,619,620,621,622,623,624,625,626,627,628,629,630,631,632,633,634,635,636,637,638,639,640,641,642,643,644],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"靈鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"ax0_dwk_ohy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0160","start":160,"end":162,"surface":"顧榮","kind":"person","person_id":"wtz_smr_dwz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p004:m0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"顧榮","kind":"person","person_id":"wtz_smr_dwz","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p005","text":"　　靈鞠好飲酒，臧否人物，在沈淵座見王儉詩，淵曰：「王令文章大進。」靈鞠曰：「何如我未進時？」此言達儉。靈鞠宋世文名甚盛，入齊頗減。蓬髮弛縱，無形儀，不治家業。王儉謂人曰：「丘公仕宦不進，才亦退矣。」遷長沙王車騎長史，太中大夫，卒。著《江左文章錄序》，起太興，訖元熙。文集行於世。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":20,"last_line":20,"raw_start":647,"raw_end":787,"raw_character_offsets":[647,648,649,650,651,652,653,654,655,656,657,658,659,660,661,662,663,664,665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,67